{"about_the_game":"<strong>The King's Tournament is a party game playable with up to 4 players in Online and Local Multiplayer.  TKT is a fun party game, with a replacement of the board game phase by transforming it into an intense combat phase where they fight for the throne !!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMBAT MODE</h2>A dynamic gameplay that replaces the usual board game phase where you will face off against your friends with an arsenal of various bullets. Inflict as much damage as possible to win. Destroy your friends with well-placed cannon balls, create alliances to prevent the first to win by joining forces against him.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081610/extras/5d403445deb536a6fbc8070a4dba117c.poster.avif?t=1753187579\" width=612 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081610/extras/5d403445deb536a6fbc8070a4dba117c.webm?t=1753187579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081610/extras/5d403445deb536a6fbc8070a4dba117c.mp4?t=1753187579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MINI-GAMES</h2>Challenge yourself to multiple mini-games in order to win various bonuses from the octopus merchant, and grant yourself powers that can give you victory. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081610/extras/2e77befc05fe7299424869effd441ad5.poster.avif?t=1753187579\" width=612 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081610/extras/2e77befc05fe7299424869effd441ad5.webm?t=1753187579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081610/extras/2e77